  "content": {
    "id": "p18-challenge-q1-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Rearrange each of these formulas to make the pronumeral in brackets the subject. (All of the pronumerals represent positive numbers.)",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$P=\\frac{M+m}{M-m}\\qquad(M)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$M=\\frac{m(P+1)}{P-1}$\n\nClear the denominator, collect the terms in $M$ and factorise.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(M-m)&=M+m\\\\PM-Pm&=M+m\\\\PM-M&=Pm+m\\\\M(P-1)&=m(P+1)\\\\M&=\\frac{m(P+1)}{P-1}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$F=\\frac{MP}{M+\\ell}\\qquad(M)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$M=\\frac{F\\ell}{P-F}$\n\nClear the denominator and collect the terms in $M$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}F(M+\\ell)&=MP\\\\FM+F\\ell&=MP\\\\F\\ell&=MP-FM\\\\M(P-F)&=F\\ell\\\\M&=\\frac{F\\ell}{P-F}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{1}{S}=\\frac{1}{R}+\\frac{1}{T}\\qquad(R)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$R=\\frac{ST}{T-S}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{R}&=\\frac{1}{S}-\\frac{1}{T}\\\\\\frac{1}{R}&=\\frac{T-S}{ST}\\\\R&=\\frac{ST}{T-S}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$E=\\frac{R}{i}+P\\qquad(i)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$i=\\frac{R}{E-P}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}E-P&=\\frac{R}{i}\\\\i(E-P)&=R\\\\i&=\\frac{R}{E-P}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$T=t-\\frac{h}{\\ell}\\qquad(\\ell)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\ell=\\frac{h}{t-T}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}t-T&=\\frac{h}{\\ell}\\\\\\ell(t-T)&=h\\\\\\ell&=\\frac{h}{t-T}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p18-challenge-q1-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$I=\\frac{M}{4}\\left(R^2+\\frac{L^2}{3}\\right)\\qquad(L)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$L=\\sqrt{\\frac{12I}{M}-3R^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4I}{M}&=R^2+\\frac{L^2}{3}\\\\\\frac{L^2}{3}&=\\frac{4I}{M}-R^2\\\\L^2&=\\frac{12I}{M}-3R^2\\\\L&=\\sqrt{\\frac{12I}{M}-3R^2}\\end{align*}$$\nTake the positive square root because $L>0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$L=\\ell\\sqrt{1+\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}\\qquad(v)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$v=\\frac{c}{\\ell}\\sqrt{L^2-\\ell^2}$\n\nIsolate the radical, square both sides and take the positive root.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{L}{\\ell}&=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{v^2}{c^2}}\\\\\\frac{L^2}{\\ell^2}&=1+\\frac{v^2}{c^2}\\\\\\frac{v^2}{c^2}&=\\frac{L^2-\\ell^2}{\\ell^2}\\\\v^2&=\\frac{c^2(L^2-\\ell^2)}{\\ell^2}\\\\v&=\\frac{c}{\\ell}\\sqrt{L^2-\\ell^2}\\end{align*}$$\nTake the positive root because all pronumerals are positive.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$T=2\\pi\\left(\\frac{1+e}{1-e}\\right)\\qquad(e)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$e=\\frac{T-2\\pi}{T+2\\pi}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}T(1-e)&=2\\pi(1+e)\\\\T-Te&=2\\pi+2\\pi e\\\\T-2\\pi&=Te+2\\pi e\\\\e(T+2\\pi)&=T-2\\pi\\\\e&=\\frac{T-2\\pi}{T+2\\pi}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$v=c\\left(\\frac{1}{r}-\\frac{1}{s}\\right)\\qquad(r)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$r=\\frac{cs}{vs+c}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{v}{c}&=\\frac{1}{r}-\\frac{1}{s}\\\\\\frac{1}{r}&=\\frac{v}{c}+\\frac{1}{s}\\\\\\frac{1}{r}&=\\frac{vs+c}{cs}\\\\r&=\\frac{cs}{vs+c}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "$P=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{h+k}{g}}\\qquad(k)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$k=g\\left(\\frac{P}{2\\pi}\\right)^2-h$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{P}{2\\pi}&=\\sqrt{\\frac{h+k}{g}}\\\\\\left(\\frac{P}{2\\pi}\\right)^2&=\\frac{h+k}{g}\\\\k&=g\\left(\\frac{P}{2\\pi}\\right)^2-h\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-k",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "k",
        "prompt": "$P=p\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\ell}}\\qquad(\\ell)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\ell=\\frac{p^2}{P^2-p^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{P}{p}&=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{\\ell}}\\\\\\frac{P^2}{p^2}&=1+\\frac{1}{\\ell}\\\\\\frac{1}{\\ell}&=\\frac{P^2-p^2}{p^2}\\\\\\ell&=\\frac{p^2}{P^2-p^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$A=\\pi(R^2-r^2)\\qquad(R)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$R=\\sqrt{\\frac{A}{\\pi}+r^2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{A}{\\pi}&=R^2-r^2\\\\R^2&=\\frac{A}{\\pi}+r^2\\\\R&=\\sqrt{\\frac{A}{\\pi}+r^2}\\end{align*}$$\nTake the positive root because $R>0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-m",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "m",
        "prompt": "$(a+b)^2+c^2=(a-d)^2\\qquad(a)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=\\frac{d^2-b^2-c^2}{2(b+d)}$\n\nExpand both squares; the $a^2$ terms cancel.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a^2+2ab+b^2+c^2&=a^2-2ad+d^2\\\\2ab+b^2+c^2&=-2ad+d^2\\\\2ab+2ad&=d^2-b^2-c^2\\\\2a(b+d)&=d^2-b^2-c^2\\\\a&=\\frac{d^2-b^2-c^2}{2(b+d)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p19-q1-n",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "n",
        "prompt": "$(M-m)^2+p^2=M^2\\qquad(M)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$M=\\frac{m^2+p^2}{2m}$\n\nExpand the square and cancel the $M^2$ terms.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}M^2-2Mm+m^2+p^2&=M^2\\\\-2Mm+m^2+p^2&=0\\\\2Mm&=m^2+p^2\\\\M&=\\frac{m^2+p^2}{2m}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      }
    ]
  },
